   "type": "text",
   "content": "{\"styles\": [{\"range\": [0, 1], \"effectStyle\": {\"id\": \"7667724588033379646\", \"path\": \"/Users/linyesh/Movies/JianyingPro/User Data/Cache/artistEffect/7667724588033379646/29bdfc9432b0363c15533b8c92712361\"}, \"size\": 15.0, \"font\": {\"id\": \"7080096840875512334\", \"path\": \"/Users/linyesh/Movies/JianyingPro/User Data/Cache/effect/7080096840875512334/a98a329c2a52154b6c50b06e66d60b12\"}, \"fill\": {\"content\": {\"render_type\": \"solid\", \"solid\": {\"color\": [1, 1, 1]}}}}], \"text\": \"初秋暑湿未尽，燥气初\\n生，饮食调理是关键。\\n减辛增酸，少吃辣椒等\\n食物，适当多吃山楂、\\n葡萄等酸味食物，帮助\\n收敛肺气。多吃梨、银\\n耳等润肺生津的食物，\\n能有效缓解秋燥引起的\\n口干、皮肤干。\"}",
   "font_size": 15,
